{"tool_name":"pyme","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"markdown","processed":"","summary":"","value":">The PYthon Microscopy Environment is an open-source package providing image acquisition and data analysis functionality for a number of microscopy applications, but with a particular emphasis on single molecule localisation microscopy (PALM/STORM/PAINT etc ...). The package is multi platform, running on Windows, Linux, and OSX.\r\n\r\nIt comes with 3 main modules:\r\n\r\n-  PYMEAcquire - Instrument control and simulation\r\n-  dh5view - Image Data Analysis and Viewing\r\n- VisGUI - Visualising Localization Data Sets"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-25T17:46:49+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-04-14T13:58:16+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1555250918,"last_comment_uid":94,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"David Baddeley"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"PYME docs","uri":"http://python-microscopy.org/doc/index.html"},{"options":[],"title":"Source code repo","uri":"https://github.com/python-microscopy/python-microscopy"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4205,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__R8EfungVXA0oQM2Ac7YY5eu","url":"/single-molecule-localisation"},{"target_id":4045,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0337","url":"/visualisation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4339,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"f1c052f1-81ff-4315-986e-e5eef75cb95c","url":"/taxonomy/term/4339"}],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3572,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"551f908e-bb43-410a-9420-9d98f12442a0","ur